  "description": "A small rurally-located cottage, finished to a high standard. The property is in a farming neighbourhood 6km from Skibbereen. As there are no rural transport services a car is fairly essential.\n\nThe cottage consists of a double bedroom, bathroom (electric shower, toilet, wash hand basin), small but fully equipped kitchen, large open sitting room with full height ceiling. There is a mezzanine level covering about half of the studio.\n\nThe weekly rental does not include services – electricity and oil-fired central heating. The cottage is well insulated and cosy, so heating bills should not be a problem good loft insulation and double glazed sash windows see to that. \n\nWifi can also be provided if required. \n\nOur own house is on the same domain but we are unobtrusive.",
